{"3950000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Factory Works Idle","steam_appid":3950000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory Works Idle is an incremental factory builder where you grow a manual workshop into an automated empire spanning the full arc of technological history, then push past the Singularity into realities that don't obey the same rules.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by gathering wood and stone with your own hands. Construct mines, mills, and laboratories. Automate production across dozens of resources and buildings. Research your way through ten distinct technological eras, each with its own visual identity and unlocks, from primitive tools to quantum computing, fusion, antimatter, and beyond.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/03264cf2961723140801d69a7cde7915.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/03264cf2961723140801d69a7cde7915.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/03264cf2961723140801d69a7cde7915.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build. Automate. Optimize.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/77da131ed99c8ee1f39c2ab7859db258.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/77da131ed99c8ee1f39c2ab7859db258.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/77da131ed99c8ee1f39c2ab7859db258.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade facilities, from lumber mills and iron mines to quantum labs and singularity cores. Each building scales hundreds of levels deep. Deploy robot-powered automation modules to manage production and research while you plan your next expansion. Active players get combo multipliers, critical hits, and click upgrades; idle players watch automated chains compound while they're away.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/6a89e48bc2ec4007aca70578bb954692.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/6a89e48bc2ec4007aca70578bb954692.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/6a89e48bc2ec4007aca70578bb954692.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ten Eras of Progress<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through stone-age gathering to the ultimate technological transcendence. Every era introduces new resources, buildings, research, and visual themes. The path from manual labor to automated singularity is long, layered, and built for players who love watching numbers climb.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/9c33ab00662b5c9272510d50a54a97fb.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/9c33ab00662b5c9272510d50a54a97fb.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/9c33ab00662b5c9272510d50a54a97fb.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond Reality: The Multiverse<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your factory outgrows this dimension, the Reality Forge awaits: a multi-phase mega-project that tears open parallel worlds. Each dimension you discover operates under its own rules: unfamiliar resources, unique production systems, and hostile forces that fight back against your expansion. Survive, adapt, and turn each new reality into another branch of your empire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/5fdf7ef2674abdde73a57683d28dcc7c.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/5fdf7ef2674abdde73a57683d28dcc7c.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/5fdf7ef2674abdde73a57683d28dcc7c.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link conquered worlds with cross-dimensional logistics. Convert and transfer resources between realities. Unlock permanent synergies that make your entire multiverse stronger together. What lies on the other side of the Singularity is for you to find, not for us to spoil.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/7160c072b5870c69ce937a9e32811785.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/7160c072b5870c69ce937a9e32811785.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/7160c072b5870c69ce937a9e32811785.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Progression<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Tree:<\/strong> Unlock buildings, resources, and systems across eras and dimensions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige System:<\/strong> Reset strategically for permanent bonuses: production, storage, click power, and research cost reduction.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading Network:<\/strong> Dynamic markets with fluctuating prices; turn surplus into rare materials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality Forge:<\/strong> Hours-long incremental construction that unlocks new realities, massive bonuses, and New Game+.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:<\/strong> Production, building, research, trading, prestige, milestones, and hidden challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active and idle play: automate production or engage with combos and critical hits<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33+ resources and 45+ buildings across multiple realities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed statistics and production analytics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric audio with era-appropriate music<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud saves and achievement sync<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games with unique rewards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Booster crafting for temporary production and research boosts<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect For<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of incremental and idle games<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy long-term progression and optimization<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy enthusiasts who love efficient production chains<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone fascinated by technological evolution and what comes after<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a click. End with a multiverse. Build the ultimate automated empire.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory Works Idle is an incremental factory builder where you grow a manual workshop into an automated empire spanning the full arc of technological history, then push past the Singularity into realities that don't obey the same rules.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by gathering wood and stone with your own hands. Construct mines, mills, and laboratories. Automate production across dozens of resources and buildings. Research your way through ten distinct technological eras, each with its own visual identity and unlocks, from primitive tools to quantum computing, fusion, antimatter, and beyond.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/03264cf2961723140801d69a7cde7915.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/03264cf2961723140801d69a7cde7915.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/03264cf2961723140801d69a7cde7915.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build. Automate. Optimize.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/77da131ed99c8ee1f39c2ab7859db258.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/77da131ed99c8ee1f39c2ab7859db258.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/77da131ed99c8ee1f39c2ab7859db258.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade facilities, from lumber mills and iron mines to quantum labs and singularity cores. Each building scales hundreds of levels deep. Deploy robot-powered automation modules to manage production and research while you plan your next expansion. Active players get combo multipliers, critical hits, and click upgrades; idle players watch automated chains compound while they're away.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/6a89e48bc2ec4007aca70578bb954692.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/6a89e48bc2ec4007aca70578bb954692.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/6a89e48bc2ec4007aca70578bb954692.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ten Eras of Progress<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through stone-age gathering to the ultimate technological transcendence. Every era introduces new resources, buildings, research, and visual themes. The path from manual labor to automated singularity is long, layered, and built for players who love watching numbers climb.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/9c33ab00662b5c9272510d50a54a97fb.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/9c33ab00662b5c9272510d50a54a97fb.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/9c33ab00662b5c9272510d50a54a97fb.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond Reality: The Multiverse<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your factory outgrows this dimension, the Reality Forge awaits: a multi-phase mega-project that tears open parallel worlds. Each dimension you discover operates under its own rules: unfamiliar resources, unique production systems, and hostile forces that fight back against your expansion. Survive, adapt, and turn each new reality into another branch of your empire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/5fdf7ef2674abdde73a57683d28dcc7c.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/5fdf7ef2674abdde73a57683d28dcc7c.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/5fdf7ef2674abdde73a57683d28dcc7c.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link conquered worlds with cross-dimensional logistics. Convert and transfer resources between realities. Unlock permanent synergies that make your entire multiverse stronger together. What lies on the other side of the Singularity is for you to find, not for us to spoil.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/7160c072b5870c69ce937a9e32811785.poster.avif?t=1793715511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/7160c072b5870c69ce937a9e32811785.webm?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/extras\/7160c072b5870c69ce937a9e32811785.mp4?t=1793715511\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Progression<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Tree:<\/strong> Unlock buildings, resources, and systems across eras and dimensions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige System:<\/strong> Reset strategically for permanent bonuses: production, storage, click power, and research cost reduction.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading Network:<\/strong> Dynamic markets with fluctuating prices; turn surplus into rare materials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality Forge:<\/strong> Hours-long incremental construction that unlocks new realities, massive bonuses, and New Game+.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:<\/strong> Production, building, research, trading, prestige, milestones, and hidden challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active and idle play: automate production or engage with combos and critical hits<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33+ resources and 45+ buildings across multiple realities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed statistics and production analytics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric audio with era-appropriate music<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cloud saves and achievement sync<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games with unique rewards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Booster crafting for temporary production and research boosts<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect For<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of incremental and idle games<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy long-term progression and optimization<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy enthusiasts who love efficient production chains<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone fascinated by technological evolution and what comes after<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a click. End with a multiverse. Build the ultimate automated empire.<\/p>","short_description":"Build an automated industrial empire from stone tools to singularity tech. Click, automate, and research through 10 eras, then breach reality to conquer parallel dimensions with unique rules, resources, and threats. Idle factory builder with deep prestige and cross-dimensional logistics.","supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/6f281a20740f4f54f08e37547a8a21ed8d327903\/header.jpg?t=1793715511","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3950000\/9ac7699d3dd7335378e612c3414382415d4f8120\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793715511","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store